  </section>

  <!-- ============== 02 · 五位主角 ============== -->
  <section id="family">
    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-500">02</span>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">五张面孔，每个都有自己的"脾气"</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
      OpenAI 在 2026 的产品逻辑彻底变了：不是一款打天下，而是<b>用命名分层</b>（Sol / Terra / Luna）+ <b>用推理档位</b>（medium / high / extra-high / max / ultra）让你按需买单。理解这一点，比背每一项 benchmark 更重要。
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-8">

      <article class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 pl-7 overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-emerald-500"></span>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">2026 旗舰</div>
        <h4 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">GPT-5.5 / GPT-5.5 Pro</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">代理式编码的天花板。Codex 默认模型。在 14 项编码 / 知识工作基准拿到 SOTA；GPT-5.5 Instant 让 ChatGPT 默认体验大幅拉高。</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-4">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:border-emerald-900">Codex 默认</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">1.1M ctx</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">$5 / $30</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">AIME 81.2</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 pl-7 overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-amber-500"></span>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">2026 旗舰 · 7 月</div>
        <h4 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">GPT-5.6 Sol</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">"Solis" —— 拉丁语"太阳"。OpenAI 在 Agents' Last Exam 拿到 53.6，领先 Claude Fable 5 整整 13.1 分。引入 <b>ultra</b> 模式：默认 4 个 sub-agent 并行（最多 16）。</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-4">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-950/40 dark:text-amber-400 dark:border-amber-900">ultra 模式</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">1.1M ctx</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">$4 / $24</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">Cyber SOTA</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 pl-7 overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-indigo-500"></span>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">平衡档 · 7 月</div>
        <h4 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">GPT-5.6 Terra</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">"大地"。定位是 GPT-5.5 水平 + 大约一半价格，胜任大多数日常知识工作。OpenAI 称它可以与 GPT-5.5 直接对位但不烧钱。</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-4">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-200 dark:bg-indigo-950/40 dark:text-indigo-400 dark:border-indigo-900">$2 / $12</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">1.1M ctx</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">Codex / API / Work</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 pl-7 overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-violet-500"></span>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">性价比档 · 7 月</div>
        <h4 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">GPT-5.6 Luna</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">"月亮"。最初 $1/$6，7 月 30 日 OpenAI 直接砍价 80%，变成全系列最便宜的高质量模型。海量调用、低延迟场景首选。</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-4">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-200 dark:bg-violet-950/40 dark:text-violet-400 dark:border-violet-900">$0.20 / $1.20</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">最快档</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">批处理友好</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 pl-7 overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-red-500"></span>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">2026-09 · 新一代</div>
        <h4 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">GPT-6 Astra</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">OpenAI 第一次把网络安全能力归到 <b>Critical 级别</b>。FrontierMath Tier 4 拿到 98%、ARC-AGI-3 拿到 99.9%、ExploitBench 100%。支持 1.05M tokens 上下文 + 128K 输出。</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-4">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-red-50 text-red-700 border border-red-200 dark:bg-red-950/40 dark:text-red-400 dark:border-red-900">$10 / $50</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">1.05M ctx</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">128K out</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">ARC-AGI-3 99.9</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 pl-7 overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-cyan-500"></span>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">编码线</div>
        <h4 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">GPT-5-Codex</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">Codex 的"工作机"。2025-09 发布，2026 全年持续在线。专门为长时程、代理式编码优化。和 Astra 配合后，Codex 体验跃升。</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-4">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-200 dark:bg-cyan-950/40 dark:text-cyan-400 dark:border-cyan-900">Codex 默认</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">$1.25 / $10</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">400K ctx</span>
        </div>
